@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5298

### Registered modules
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules

### Install: upload the zipped build output of src/WebApi/Modules/Custom/WebApi.Modules.Greeting (bin/Debug/net10.0/*)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=module

--module
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="package"; filename="greeting.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./greeting.zip
--module--

### Activate (load + services + routes)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules/greeting/activate

### Call the module
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/greeting/john_doe

### Module POST endpoint
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/greeting/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "hello runtime world" }

### Change settings (applied on next load)
PUT {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules/greeting/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Greeting:Prefix": "Ahlan" }

### Deactivate (routes removed, still loaded)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules/greeting/deactivate

### Unload (dispose services, unload assemblies)
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules/greeting/unload

### Unloaded but not yet collected
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules/unloading

### Uninstall
DELETE {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/modules/greeting
